ord event is fired.\r\nIf it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called.","InfoMap":{"$id":"1134","FullIdObj":{"$id":"1135","$type":"IdentificableText","Name":"Creates a Production History Record based on the details of the transaction that is triggered.\r\nThe command takes all the details of the triggered transaction as input. It checks the value set for Configuration Key: EnableEventBasedTracing.\r\nIf it is set to True, the TraceProductionRecord event is fired.\r\nIf it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called.","FullInfo":"Creates a Production History Record based on the details of the transaction that is triggered.\r\nThe command takes all the details of the triggered transaction as input. It checks the value set for Configuration Key: EnableEventBasedTracing.\r\nIf it is set to True, the TraceProductionRecord event is fired.\r\nIf it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called.","TypeResolved":""}},"FullIdObj":{"$ref":"1135"},"Children":[],"Name":"Documentation","SystemAnnotations":[],"CustomAnnotations":[],"TagAnnotations":[],"_text":"Creates a Production History Record based on the details of the transaction that is triggered.\r\nThe command takes all the details of the triggered transaction as input. It checks the value set for Configuration Key: EnableEventBasedTracing.\r\nIf it is set to True, the TraceProductionRecord event is fired.\r\nIf it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called.","Siemens.SimaticIT.DSL.Plugin.ILeafNode.Text":"Creates a Production History Record based on the details of the transaction that is triggered.\r\nThe command takes all the details of the triggered transaction as input. It checks the value set for Configuration Key: EnableEventBasedTracing.\r\nIf it is set to True, the TraceProductionRecord event is fired.\r\nIf it is set to False, the AddProductionTraces internal command is called."},"SystemAnnotations":[{"$id":"1136","$ty